{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"2f557ab92d96318a05f7df2a6b2c54e2bcf93171d461e1e74d6b4b23e884638f","ja":"歩の悩み","zh":"步的烦恼","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f8c67fdf6c0d75ee7086cfced6952aff8ceaaaa173d2db15ada57080adcaaf38","ja":"次の日……","zh":"第二天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"93edffbbe9f8ca06db5487c20f4849c84bb6a71ca6c7cb8ca59478d9e84333d6","ja":"人に『選ばせる』のって、きっと度胸以外にも、\n自分の魅力に自信がないとダメなんだろうなあ……。","zh":"要让别人“来选择自己”，肯定不仅需要胆量，\n还得对自己的魅力有自信才行吧……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"951c258c6f1f31f7cdf20738fcdb33e9aa46f19c4be54af2936e772584323d47","ja":"歩さん……、どうか、した……？\nなんか、元気がない……。","zh":"步……怎么了……？\n总觉得……没有什么精神……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e407f39d74f3b025c7692556da3fcafa5b3d00208848a2f469ffcd3c83052ce7","ja":"ああ……ほら、昨日の最終問題でさ、\nみんなが一斉に手をあげた中で、杏奈が選ばれただろ。","zh":"啊……你看，昨天最后一题的时候，\n大家齐刷刷举手，结果杏奈被选上了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"eb5c6db32131dbc970a1ffd0a680da6dc1f54df1a83439af10b3ad707ebf504c","ja":"それって、あの中で杏奈が一番、\n目を惹いたってことなんだろうな～と思って……。","zh":"那是不是说明，在那些人里面杏奈最\n引人注目呢～我就这么想了一下……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5ee7a3649c59f7485429bec8e01788dbedd0e7f0df64d369360454253c64eb69","ja":"え……そう、なのかな……？　えへへ……。","zh":"诶……是，这样吗……？嘿嘿……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"72bd669a10150c696ce9f595d0e8917b3815d2e00eb3ff9365962c793c70be7b","ja":"うん。アイドルしてるときの杏奈って、キラキラ\nしてて、目が惹きつけられちゃうっていうか。","zh":"嗯。做偶像时的杏奈闪闪发亮的，\n总让人不由自主地被吸引视线呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fcf262fa2f6a1cc948728e2b1f57887a273b90f60c1dae211c6b441ae676031e","ja":"ほら、クロエも「選ばれるんじゃなくて、\n自分を選ばせるのがアイドル」って言ってたし……。","zh":"你看，克洛伊也说过“偶像不是被选择，\n而是要让他们选择自己”……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"97a28d67da677ac9a375261c694b5ffad6e7013a1361b8a8c33eb98220b466a3","ja":"アタシもそんなアイドルになれるように、\nもっと度胸をつけなきゃ！って、思ってるんだけどさ。","zh":"为了我也能成为那样的偶像，\n我虽然一直觉得必须要更加有胆量才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"8503bc9c589c0dbacb5632e58ad4425588f6bb1cc1abaf21bfeab1320aaf64ad","ja":"ダンス以外だと、どうにもビビっちゃって……。\nカッコ悪いな～。","zh":"一旦离开舞蹈，就不由得胆怯起来……\n真差劲啊～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"32f6b745a08636565b2383cb28f002f75600ecc1d8a59af7a43cac5eae691ffa","ja":"……そんなこと……ないと、思う……よ。","zh":"……应该……不会……那样的吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d7f11d440d4aa144a02492b202ec786020da54f970a0e0427e60f0e7cbd3a534","ja":"杏奈……歩さんは、ダンス以外でも\n選ばせること……できると思う、な……。","zh":"杏奈觉得……即使不是跳舞，\n步小姐也一定能……让人选择她的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"7a67afa1b8f02c32daaa5e2a4f2f35c93f4a3e319d128af8452b2faa096d0350","ja":"えっ！？　アタシが？","zh":"诶！？我吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"454226c66893b11118db50e4b5530a2924d37b37651f417d75a4126978ee37c6","ja":"うん。えっと……歩さんの、次のお仕事……\n歌、だった……よね。","zh":"嗯。那个……步小姐接下来的工作……\n是唱歌……对吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1467.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c2080bc974900cfe9e96734bdd2c8ba25ea921eaf008285f4ae1602982546be8","ja":"……きっと、次のお仕事は……歩さんが、\n『選ばせる』側になると……思う、よ……。","zh":"……下一次的工作……我想，步小姐\n一定会变成……“让人选择”的那一方……的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
